"这个版本已经过当前控制器验证。" = "This version has been verified with the current controller.";
"当前控制器验证版本为 %@；更新后部分插件或 Profile 可能需要同步升级。" = "This controller is verified with %@. After updating, some plugins or Profiles may also need updates.";
"更新会安全停止服务、事务化替换应用托管的 DSH，然后重新启动原本正在运行的服务。" = "The update safely stops the service, transactionally replaces the app-managed DSH, and restarts the service only if it was running.";
"当前 DSH 由应用外部管理。继续会切换到应用托管版本；若服务正在运行，会先安全停止再重新启动。" = "The current DSH is managed outside this app. Continuing switches to the app-managed version; a running service is safely stopped and restarted.";
"发现 DSH 更新" = "DSH Update Available";
"当前版本：%@\n最新版本：%@\n\n%@\n%@" = "Installed: %@\nLatest: %@\n\n%@\n%@";
"更新到 %@" = "Update to %@";
"安装 DeepSeek Harness 运行环境？" = "Install the DeepSeek Harness Runtime?";
"应用会先检测并复用这台 Mac 上现有且兼容的 DSH 与 Node.js；不会覆盖用户安装的环境。只有 DSH 缺失、损坏或版本低于 %@ 时才补装应用托管的 DSH；只有 Node.js 缺失、损坏或低于 20 时才下载私有 Node.js。不需要管理员权限。需要下载时会访问 nodejs.org 和 npm 官方注册表。" = "The app first detects and reuses compatible DSH and Node.js installations already on this Mac; it never overwrites a user-managed environment. It installs an app-managed DSH only when DSH is missing, broken, or older than %@, and downloads private Node.js only when Node.js is missing, broken, or older than 20. Administrator access is not required. Downloads, when needed, use nodejs.org and the official npm registry.";
"一键安装" = "Install Automatically";
"无法安装运行环境" = "Could Not Install Runtime";
"端口 3080 正被其他服务占用。请先释放端口，再重试更新。" = "Port 3080 is in use by another service. Free the port before retrying the update.";
"停止外部启动的 Harness 以继续？" = "Stop the Externally Started Harness to Continue?";
"端口 3080 上的 Harness 不是由当前控制器启动的。安装托管运行环境需要先停止它，可能会中断终端或其他工具中的任务；完成后控制器会重新启动服务。" = "The Harness service on port 3080 was not started by this controller. Installing the managed runtime must stop it first and may interrupt work in Terminal or other tools; the controller restarts the service afterward.";
"停止并继续" = "Stop and Continue";
"应用内置安装器缺失。请重新下载完整安装包。" = "The bundled runtime installer is missing. Download the complete package again.";
"无法写入安装日志：%@" = "Could not write the installation log: %@";
"DSH 更新完成" = "DSH Update Complete";
"运行环境已就绪" = "Runtime Ready";
"已选择可用的现有环境，或补齐了缺失组件。控制器现在会启动服务。" = "A working existing environment was selected, or only missing components were added. The controller will now start the service.";
"已安装 DSH %@。控制器现在会重新启动此前运行的服务。" = "DSH %@ is installed. The controller will now restart the service that was previously running.";
"已安装 DSH %@。服务保持停止，可随时从 Dock 或鲸鱼菜单打开。" = "DSH %@ is installed. The service remains stopped and can be opened from the Dock or whale menu at any time.";
"运行环境安装失败" = "Runtime Installation Failed";
"安装 DSH 依赖时耗尽了 Node.js 内存。请先关闭占用内存较多的应用后重试；安装器会根据设备内存使用 3–8 GB 的堆上限。失败的候选环境未被启用，原有环境已保留。日志：%@" = "Node.js ran out of memory while installing DSH dependencies. Close memory-intensive apps and retry; the installer uses a device-adaptive 3–8 GB heap limit. The failed candidate was not activated, and the previous environment was preserved. Log: %@";
"失败的候选运行环境未被启用；如果此前已有可用运行环境，它已被保留。请检查网络后重试，或查看日志：%@" = "The failed runtime candidate was not activated. If a working runtime already existed, it was preserved. Check your network and retry, or inspect the log: %@";
"重试" = "Retry";
"正在安装运行环境" = "Runtime Installation in Progress";
"请等待当前 DSH 安装或更新完成后再退出，避免中断已开始的安全替换。" = "Wait for the current DSH installation or update to finish before quitting so the safe replacement is not interrupted.";

"端口 3080 已被占用" = "Port 3080 Is Already in Use";
