"DeepSeek Harness 使用说明" = "DeepSeek Harness User Guide";
"• 点击 Dock：按默认方式打开或回到 Harness\n• 点击菜单栏小鲸鱼：查看状态、切换打开方式、重启或停止服务\n• 从“服务”菜单可主动检查 DSH 更新，确认后才会安装\n• 灰色空心点表示服务已停止，绿色实心点表示运行正常；橙色表示处理中，红色表示异常\n• 应用内窗口关闭后，小鲸鱼和服务仍继续运行\n• “登录时静默启动”只启动小鲸鱼，不自动打开页面" = "• Click the Dock icon to open or return to Harness using your default method\n• Click the whale in the menu bar to check status, change the opening method, restart, or stop the service\n• Use the Service menu to check for DSH updates; installation starts only after confirmation\n• A hollow gray circle means the service is stopped, while a solid green circle means it is healthy; orange means work is in progress and red means an error\n• Closing the in-app window keeps the whale and service running\n• Launch Silently at Login starts only the whale and does not open a page";
"版本 %@\n本地地址：%@\n默认打开方式：%@\n服务状态：%@\n\n控制器不会存储或上传你的 DeepSeek 凭据。" = "Version %@\nLocal Address: %@\nDefault Opening Method: %@\nService Status: %@\n\nThe controller does not store or upload your DeepSeek credentials.";
